# RULES: AUTH

## Role

Define authentication, authorization, and access-protection norms.

## What to fill in during synthesis

- session and credential flow;
- guards, restricted routes, and redirects;
- roles/capabilities and permission checks;
- prohibitions (e.g. exposing tokens/secrets, bypassing guards);
- approved behaviors to preserve across any change.

## Typical triggers

- auth, session, role, permission, guard, or redirect;
- any change touching restricted flows.
